mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10292210","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:0:1029221001:0":{"text":"I can't wait to teach these deserters a lesson.","source_cn":"我已经等不及要给这些逃兵一点教训了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E5359E14820EED2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1029221002:0":{"text":"S-Shakir! What are you doing here? Tomlin, what should we do?","source_cn":"沙、沙奎尔！你们怎么会在这里……汤姆林，怎么办？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC471747C619EFCB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1029221003:0":{"text":"We just got to do it. Robin, we defeat them together!","source_cn":"只能硬着头皮上了。罗宾，我们一起打赢他们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC84417DD84DFE4CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:沙奎尔":{"text":"Shakir","source":"沙奎尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:盗宝贼罗宾":{"text":"Thief Robin","source":"盗宝贼罗宾","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:盗宝贼汤姆林":{"text":"Thief Tomlin","source":"盗宝贼汤姆林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":3}},"jp":{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10292210","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10292210","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1029221001:0":{"text":"逃亡兵どもに仕置きをするのが待ちきれないな。","source_cn":"我已经等不及要给这些逃兵一点教训了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E5359E14820EED2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1029221002:0":{"text":"シャ、シャキール！？どうしてここに……トムリン、どうする？","source_cn":"沙、沙奎尔！你们怎么会在这里……汤姆林，怎么办？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC471747C619EFCB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1029221003:0":{"text":"やるしかないだろ！ロビン、一緒にこいつらをぶちのめすぞ！","source_cn":"只能硬着头皮上了。罗宾，我们一起打赢他们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC84417DD84DFE4CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:沙奎尔":{"text":"シャキール","source":"沙奎尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:盗宝贼罗宾":{"text":"賊のロビン","source":"盗宝贼罗宾","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:盗宝贼汤姆林":{"text":"トムリン","source":"盗宝贼汤姆林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":3}},"kr":{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10292210","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10292210","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1029221001:0":{"text":"탈영병 녀석들을 혼내주고 싶어서 벌써 몸이 근질근질한걸?","source_cn":"我已经等不及要给这些逃兵一点教训了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E5359E14820EED2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1029221002:0":{"text":"샤, 샤키르! 너희가 어떻게 여기에... 톰, 어떡하지?","source_cn":"沙、沙奎尔！你们怎么会在这里……汤姆林，怎么办？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC471747C619EFCB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_re